7592186409537 1071 "Consider the following false statement.\n\n$9n-4$ is even for any $n\\in Z$" 13194139533573 17592186045417 true] [17592186409537 1072 #uuid "e3db273a-c488-5a82-8422-fe1e9221beaa" 13194139533573 17592186045417 true] [17592186409537 1074 "Our statement can be written as\n\n$$\n∀n\\in Z,\\,9n-4\\text{ is even}.\n$$\n\nSince this statement is false, its negation is true. \n\nA *counterexample* is a particular case that disproves the statement. Equivalently, it's a case that proves the negation is true. \n\nThe negation of our statement is\n\n$$\n¬(∀n\\in Z,\\,9n-4\\text{ is even})\\,≡\\,∃n\\in Z,\\,9n-4\\text{ is odd}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\nA counterexample for the above statement would be an integer $n$ such that $9n-4$ is $\\text{odd}.$" 13194139533573 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-045b7395-71a2-554c-828d-fd5ca75abab2" 17592186409516 "answer-46255983-63bd-5575-a696-22f606d6b1dd" 17592186409517 "answer-4760ba7c-43f4-5060-a452-2d81c2c07c7f" 17592186409518 "answer-6fd88ff2-9c21-5c96-9996-8e259a0080e2" 17592186409519 "answer-785be389-2c7e-5e32-bac1-d9b8c6fc0bda" 17592186409520 "answer-7b1b243b-3cfe-5281-a9ad-388d6c710076" 17592186409521 "answer-84993c3c-9066-53b6-92d8-9f77ef13102d" 17592186409522 "answer-96a6ebcc-0012-57b5-881e-b7398c1c2b29" 17592186409523 "answer-bcef612b-10f0-5336-a6eb-34c5b1e4d0ff" 17592186409524 "answer-cfbbb7fe-3550-5cd8-9e28-5b776f3b0385" 17592186409525 "answer-d8205af2-6ecd-55f3-8489-17a62e4ae515" 17592186409526 "answer-dd07ce54-e09b-5ee5-bdef-40f6791b1af1" 17592186409527 "answer-e4c412ad-192c-5350-b0fd-49adc6020ca4" 17592186409528 "answer-f669ffe5-88ca-5b07-91ce-5e49a9167938" 17592186409529 "answer-fc6a3b62-d2b0-59d7-a6de-214f1bb5b3e7" 17592186409530 "answer-field-21ae7b36-dd6b-59ff-af6c-6f41d79d0ecf" 17592186409531 "answer-field-3aa78bb9-b187-5d4c-8bbf-7bbaca9dd68f" 17592186409532 "answer-field-543c8dd4-cd46-5d7b-b872-28f5e756c28c" 17592186409533 "answer-field-5ea8a2d7-9fc6-5058-876a-d88758e